🚀 **Day 40 of the Claude Coding Challenge – Build Your Own AI Assistant**

Today I built an **AI-Powered Mock Interview Assistant**—a production-ready AI application created from **a single prompt** in Claude.

This project goes beyond building a chatbot. It demonstrates how to design AI products by combining **user experience, prompt engineering, and intelligent workflows**.

💡 **What it does:**
✅ Personalizes interviews based on role, company, and experience
✅ Supports resume or job description uploads for tailored questions
✅ Simulates natural interview conversations
✅ Tracks confidence throughout the session
✅ Generates a detailed feedback report with strengths, improvement areas, confidence scores, and actionable coaching

### Key Learnings

🔹 Design AI assistants around real user problems
🔹 Engineer production-quality system prompts
🔹 Blend UX with AI to create engaging experiences
🔹 Build purpose-driven interfaces instead of generic chat windows

The biggest takeaway? **The value of an AI product isn't just the model—it's the experience you design around it.**

